<title>USA: First Industrial names chief investment officer.</title>
<headline>First Industrial names chief investment officer.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Monday it named Johannson Yap to the newly created position of chief investment officer.</p>
<p>Yap has served First Industrial and its predecessor company for nine years in various positions, including senior vice president of acquisitions.</p>
<p>First Industrial Realty is a real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
